{"inkVersion":21,"root":[[["done",{"#f":5,"#n":"g-0"}],null],"done",{"BEGINNING":[["^You had something to say? ","#","^Yael","/#","\n","ev",1,{"f()":"IncreaseTension"},"pop","/ev","\n","ev","str","^Talk about the Ritual ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},"ev","str","^Talk about Jasper ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":4},"ev","str","^Ask her about herself ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},"ev","str","^Nevermind.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"START"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ",{"->":"JASPER"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ ",{"->":"HERSELF"},"\n",{"#f":5}],"c-3":["^ ","done","\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"JASPER":[["#","^Yael","/#","^What about her?","\n","ev","str","^Are you and Jasper getting along well? ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Rock ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Nevermind. ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":4},{"c-0":["\n","^I believe that the Ritual is more important than whether or not we get along. I have my reservations about her, of course. I'm not sure why the Sunblades don't visit the city more often.","\n",["ev","str","^. ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"JASPER"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^What am I supposed to do with this?","\n",["ev","str","^I don't know. ","#","^EdrickChoice","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":4},{"c-0":["^ ",{"->":"JASPER"},"\n",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-2":["^ ",{"->":"START"},"\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"START":[["#","^Yael","/#","^Oh yes! I have everything ready. The needle, thread and basin, I trust are with your things?","\n","ev","str","^Yes, I have them. ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","#","^Yael","/#","^Do you take me for a fan of the apocalypse? I'd rather work with a country bumpkin than watch my people suffer.","\n",["ev","str","^Really? ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Country bumpkin?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^How will you prepare for the journey ahead?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-2","flg":20},"ev","str","^You seem rather devoted. ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},"ev","str","^Give yourself to her? Doesn't that sound a bit... strange? ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":20},"ev","str","^What will you do in your free time? ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Yes, really. The equinox has no preference for sun or moon. It will destroy all, unless we destroy it.","\n",["ev","str","^Do you think we can do it? ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Of course I do. I know I can lead us to a favorable outcome, if Jasper listens to me.","\n",["ev","str","^I believe in you. ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^Are you sure?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-1","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^No need to believe in something that is factual. If you trust me, you simply know it.","\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Why are you prodding at me like a horse? Time will tell. Now go to bed.","\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-1":["^ ","\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","#","^Yael","/#","^The Goddess will bless me and keep me, all I must do is give myself to her.","\n",{"#f":5}],"c-3":["\n","^I pride myself in that. I am to be the next Cresent-maiden after all - and a priestess that strays from the path is no priestess at all.","\n","done",{"#f":5}],"c-4":["\n","#","^Yael","/#","^It is our way. Moonwalkers can't see themselves as people, only vessels for her will. You will do well to not insult my tradition.","\n",["ev","str","^Well, what's her will right now? ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^To go to bed, obviously.","\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}],"c-5":["^ ","\n","#","^Yael","/#","^Most likely I will return to prayer. I don't find anything here endearing enough to go outside. It's just gross.","\n","done",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"HERSELF":[["#","^YaelPensive","/#","^What would you like to know, Calibrator?","\n","ev","str","^You mentioned you were wanting to be Tethered to someone else. ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","#","^Yael","/#","^...It's true. My wife, Kethora, and I were hoping to be Tethered. But I suppose it was naive. There's no way to influence the Tethering, even if it seems to favor some people.","\n",["ev","str","^I noticed you ","#","^EdrickContinue","/#","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-0","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","done","end",{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"IncreaseTension":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"tension"},{"VAR?":"amount"},"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"tension","re":true},{"#f":1}],"DecreaseTension":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"tension"},{"VAR?":"amount"},"-","/ev",{"VAR=":"tension","re":true},{"#f":1}],"SetJaspersWay":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"jaspersWay","re":true},{"#f":1}],"SetYaelsWay":["ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"yaelsWay","re":true},{"#f":1}],"ChangeNotesIndex":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"amount"},"/ev",{"VAR=":"NotesIndex","re":true},{"#f":1}],"ExtendedTutorial":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"amount"},"/ev",{"VAR=":"ExternalTutorialNum","re":true},{"#f":1}],"UpdatePopupNumber":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"amount"},"/ev",{"VAR=":"PopupNum","re":true},{"#f":1}],"IncreaseYaelExhaust":[{"temp=":"amount"},"ev",{"VAR?":"YaelExhaust"},{"VAR?":"amount"},"+","/ev",{"VAR=":"YaelExhaust","re":true},{"#f":1}],"global decl":["ev",0,{"VAR=":"YaelTell"},false,{"VAR=":"jaspersWay"},false,{"VAR=":"yaelsWay"},0,{"VAR=":"YaelExhaust"},0,{"VAR=":"JasperExhaust"},0,{"VAR=":"ExternalTutorialNum"},0,{"VAR=":"PopupNum"},14,{"VAR=":"tension"},0,{"VAR=":